OL,3,AAnthropic heads for lower than expected
OL,4,A$1.3 trillion valuation in stock market
OL,5,Adebut
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnthropic, the AI company behind the
OL,8,FClaude chatbot, could be valued at
OL,9,Faround $1.3 trillion (#1 trillion) when
OL,10,Fit lists its shares for sale on New
OL,11,FYork's Nasdaq stock exchange.
OL,13,FThe loss-making company says it will
OL,14,Foffer its shares for between $70 and
OL,15,F$78 each and will raise up to $64bn
OL,16,Fwhen it floats this month.
OL,18,FIt would value Anthropic at between
OL,19,F$1.1tn and $1.3tn which, although
OL,20,Flarge, is below the $2tn some backers
OL,21,Fof the firm predicted in summer,
OL,22,Faccording to the Financial Times.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/20
